<title>USA: InPhyNet wins three military contracts.</title>
<headline>InPhyNet wins three military contracts.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>InPhyNet Medical Management Inc said on Friday that it was awarded three military contracts to staff seven emergency departments and one ambulatory care center.</p>
<p>The five-year contracts will begin February 1, 1997, and will generate about $8.3 million in revenue during the first year of operations.</p>
</text>
